---Layer within `ground-natural` [tile render layer](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/TileRenderLayer.html) group, before which terrain lightmap alpha channel is copied into water mask. Decals, which need to be masked by water should have their [DecorativePrototype::tile\_layer](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/DecorativePrototype.html%23tile_layer#tile_layer) set to only slightly larger value than `capture_water_mask_at_layer`, to avoid risk of undefined behavior caused by rendering tiles into layers between `capture_water_mask_at_layer` and decal's `tile_layer`.
